# name: test_add_copula_dimension_mismatch
  '''
  1 validation error for OTJointDistribution_Settings
    Value error, The dimension of the block-independent copula at position 0 must be equal to the number of components (1); got 2. [type=value_error, input_value={'marginal_settings': [OT...ns=2 values=[1,0,0,1])]}, input_type=dict]
      For further information visit https://errors.pydantic.dev/X.Y/v/value_error
  '''
