# name: test_get_pretty_table
  '''
  +------+-------------------------------+
  | name |          distribution         |
  +------+-------------------------------+
  | x    | Uniform(lower=0.0, upper=1.0) |
  | x    | Uniform(lower=0.0, upper=1.0) |
  | y    |   Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0)   |
  +------+-------------------------------+
  '''
# ---
# name: test_get_pretty_table_of_an_empty_space
  '''
  +------+
  | name |
  +------+
  +------+
  '''
# ---
# name: test_get_pretty_table_with_index
  '''
  +------+-------------------------------+
  | name |          distribution         |
  +------+-------------------------------+
  | x[0] | Uniform(lower=0.0, upper=1.0) |
  | x[1] | Uniform(lower=0.0, upper=1.0) |
  | y    |   Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0)   |
  +------+-------------------------------+
  '''
# ---
# name: test_get_pretty_table_with_transformation
  '''
  +------+---------------------------+--------------------+
  | name |    initial distribution   | transformation(x)= |
  +------+---------------------------+--------------------+
  | x    | Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0) |         x          |
  | y    | Normal(mu=0.0, sigma=1.0) |       (x)+2        |
  +------+---------------------------+--------------------+
  '''
