# name: test_str_with_block_independent_copulas
  '''
  Random space: u
  +------+---------------------------+
  | Name |        Distribution       |
  +------+---------------------------+
  | a    | Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0) |
  | b    | Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0) |
  | c    | Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0) |
  | d    | Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0) |
  +------+---------------------------+
  Copulas: (a, c) -> NormalCopula, (b, d) -> NormalCopula
  '''
# ---
# name: test_str_with_copula
  '''
  Random space: u
  +------+-------------------------------+
  | Name |          Distribution         |
  +------+-------------------------------+
  | x[0] | Uniform(lower=0.0, upper=1.0) |
  | x[1] | Uniform(lower=0.0, upper=1.0) |
  | y    |   Normal(mu=1.0, sigma=2.0)   |
  +------+-------------------------------+
  Copulas: (x, y) -> NormalCopula
  '''
